					"content": "嗯？該不會是突然有了對歷史的興趣吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300619,
					"content": "是啊。所以，想再問一個問題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300620
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30300620,
					"content": "好啊，請說。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300621,
					"content": "你聽說過踏鞴砂有一個「傾奇者」嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300622
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30300622,
					"content": "傾奇者？唔…好像沒聽過呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300623,
					"content": "我知道這個詞在稻妻通常指那些特立獨行、衣飾特殊的人，倒是一直想見見配得上這個說辭的人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300624
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300624,
					"content": "但很可惜，既沒見過這類人，也沒在與踏鞴砂有關的說法裡聽過相關事宜。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300625,
					"content": "（沒有傾奇者…難道說散兵在世界樹裡做了什麼，成功抹去了有關自己的紀錄？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300626
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30300626,
					"content": "（如果是那樣，他應該是想改變世界，讓一切回到原點吧。但是，目前看來所有影響只跟他自己有關？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300627
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30300627,
					"content": "謝謝你，澤維爾。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300628
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30300628,
					"content": "沒什麼，不用客氣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300629
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300629,
					"content": "要走了嗎？那再見啦澤維爾！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300630
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300630,
					"content": "噢！不必客氣，我能幫上忙就好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300631
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300631,
					"content": "那就再會了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300632
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300632,
					"content": "#看來，{F#妳}{M#你}想問的事都打聽到了呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300633
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300633,
					"content": "回去見小吉祥草王吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300634
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30300634,
					"content": "#好啊，不過，不知道{F#妳}{M#你}今天到底怎麼了…看起來心事重重的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300635
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300635,
					"content": "#打起精神來呀！無論發生什麼我都會陪著{F#妳}{M#你}的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300636,
						30300638
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300636,
					"content": "…嗯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300637
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30300637,
					"content": "要振作哦，不行的話就吃點東西！空腹的人無法戰勝生活！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300640
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300640,
					"content": "那麼，出發去見納西妲吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300638,
					"content": "謝謝妳，派蒙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300639
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30300639,
					"content": "我們之間客氣什麼嘛，嘿嘿。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300640
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 303010,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
